                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}_D
            via the unique ring homomorphism
            = succeed ":" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
