          %h2#References References
          %p
            See also the references at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+number"} real number
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+analysis"} constructive analysis
          %p Original articles:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Georg+Cantor"}> Georg Cantor
              ; 1872;
              = succeed ";" do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.tcd.ie/pub/HistMath/People/Cantor/Ausdehnung/"} Ueber die Ausdehnung eines Satzes aus der Theorie der trigonometrischen Reihen
          %p
            Dicussion in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+analysis"} constructive analysis
          %ul
            %li#Bishop67
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Errett+Bishop"}> Errett Bishop
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Foundations+of+Constructive+Analysis"} Foundations of Constructive Analysis
            %li#BishopBridges85
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Errett+Bishop"}> Errett Bishop
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Bridges"} Douglas Bridges
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Constructive+Analysis"} Constructive Analysis
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 279
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-61667-9"} doi:10.1007/978-3-642-61667-9
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fred+Richman"}> Fred Richman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Bridges"} Douglas Bridges
                = succeed "." do
                  %em A weak countable choice principle
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9939-00-05327-2"} doi:10.1090/S0002-9939-00-05327-2
          %p#ReferencesCauchyCompleteness
            The proof that Cauchy sequences (with a modulus of convergence) as such (i.e. not passing to their
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+classes"} equivalence classes
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sequentially+Cauchy+complete"} sequentially Cauchy complete
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#Bishop67"} Bishop (1967, p. 27)
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#BishopBridges85"} Bishop &amp; Bridges (1985, p. 29)
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fred+Richman"}> Fred Richman
              ,
              = succeed "." do
                %em The fundamental theorem of algebra: a constructive development without choice
              %strong 196
              1 (2000) 213–230 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.2140/pjm.2000.196.213"}> doi:10.2140/pjm.2000.196.213
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://msp.org/pjm/2000/196-1/pjm-v196-n1-p10-p.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On why the (modulated) Cauchy real numbers, hence after passage to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+classes"} equivalence classes
            of Cauchy sequences, are not
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sequentially+Cauchy+complete"} sequentially Cauchy complete
            (without the
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom+of+countable+choice"} axiom of countable choice
          %ul
            %li#Lubarsky
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Lubarsky"}> Robert Lubarsky
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the Cauchy Completeness of the Constructive Cauchy Reals
              %strong 167
              (2007) 225-254 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.entcs.2006.09.012"}> doi:10.1016/j.entcs.2006.09.012
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Auke+Booij"}> Auke Booij
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Extensional constructive real analysis via locators
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.06781"} abs:1805.06781
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+mathematics"} constructive
            algebraic proof of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+theorem+of+algebra"} fundamental theorem of algebra
            for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modulated+Cauchy+real+numbers"} modulated Cauchy real numbers
            without countable choice:
          %ul
            %li
              Wim Ruitenberg, Constructing Roots of Polynomials over the Complex Numbers, Computational Aspects of Lie Group Representations and Related Topics, CWI Tract, Vol. 84, Centre for Mathematics and Computer Science, Amsterdam, 1991, pp. 107–128. (
              %a{:href => "https://www.mscsnet.mu.edu/~wim/publica/roots_new.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            Implementation of
            = succeed "-style" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Errett+Bishop"} Bishop
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy+real+numbers"} Cauchy real numbers
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Agda"} Agda
          %ul
            %li#Lundfall15
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Martin+Lundfall"}> Martin Lundfall
                ,
                %em Formalizing real numbers in Agda
                (2015) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://wcl.cs.rpi.edu/pilots/library/papers/TAGGED/4211-Lundfall%20(2015)%20-%20Formalizing%20Real%20Numbers%20in%20Agda.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Lundfall-RealNumbersInAgda.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://github.com/MrChico/Reals-in-agda"} github
            %li#Murray22
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zachary+Murray"}> Zachary Murray
                ,
                %em Constructive Analysis in the Agda Proof Assistant
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.08354"}> arXiv:2205.08354
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://github.com/z-murray/honours-project-constructive-analysis-in-agda"} github
          %p review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zachary+Murray"}> Zachary Murray
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Constructive Real Numbers in the Agda Proof Assistant
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "Center+for+Quantum+and+Topological+Systems#MurrayFeb2023"}
                  talk at
                  %em CQTS
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Q_sjfyPJqU"} YT
          %p
            A novel construction principle of the type of real numbers, as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+inductive-inductive+type"} higher inductive-inductive type
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/univalence+axiom"} univalent
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+numbers"} rational numbers
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cauchy+completeness"} Cauchy completeness
            even without extra
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom+of+countable+choice"} axiom of countable choice
            is laid out (cf.
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/HoTT+book+real+numbers"} HoTT book real numbers
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Univalent+Foundations+Project"}> Univalent Foundations Project
              \: Chapter 11 of:
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Homotopy+Type+Theory+%E2%80%93+Univalent+Foundations+of+Mathematics"} Homotopy Type Theory – Univalent Foundations of Mathematics
              (2013) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://homotopytypetheory.org/book/"}> web
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://hottheory.files.wordpress.com/2013/03/hott-online-323-g28e4374.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            but has not yet been implemented in any
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proof+assistant"} proof assistant
          %p Exposition and review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrej+Bauer"}> Andrej Bauer
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The real numbers in homotopy type theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "http://cca-net.de/cca2016/"} Computability and Complexity in Analysis
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://math.andrej.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/hott-reals-cca2016.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Bauer-RealsInHoTT.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#Booij20
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Auke+Booij"}> Auke Booij
                ,
                %em Analysis in Univalent Type Theory
                (2020) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://etheses.bham.ac.uk/id/eprint/10411"}> etheses:10411
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://etheses.bham.ac.uk/id/eprint/10411/7/Booij2020PhD.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
